    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just sadness though. it's just... quiet. like the pilot light went out for good and no matter how much i try to relight it, there's nothing there. i look at my old work and i dont even recognize that person. it feels like i'm just ghosts haunting my own life. how am i supposed to keep pretending to be a person when there's nothing inside anymore?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
